sequenceDiagram
  participant Drv as molt driver
  participant Dut as odc-onboard-v2
  participant Wan as WAN eth0 or wwan0
  participant Vpn as vpn component
  participant Hub as hexa-five tunnel-manager

  Drv->>Dut: apply VPN fixture YAML
  Dut->>Wan: assert upstream route/DNS
  Drv->>Dut: graph.components.start vpn_lab
  Dut->>Vpn: start peer config
  Vpn->>Hub: handshake / TLS / WG keys
  Hub-->>Vpn: tunnel established
  Vpn-->>Dut: TransportBinding ip_ready
  Dut-->>Drv: vpn.status connected + iface IP
  Drv->>Hub: peer list / handshake age
  Note over Drv,Hub: ping overlay IP both directions
  Drv->>Dut: disconnect then reconnect
  Vpn-->>Dut: ip_lost then ip_ready
